ccop-oscal
=================

This repository publishes OSCAL 1.1.2 conversion artifacts derived from the Cybersecurity Code of Practice (29 July 2026).

Source document
---------------

Title:     Cybersecurity Code of Practice (CCoP)
Publisher: Cybersecurity Agency of Singapore
Published: 2027-07-29
URL:       https://isomer-user-content.by.gov.sg/36/8b555ddb-16ab-486c-9fda-e12197a4e320/Cybersecurity%20Code%20of%20Practice%20(2026).pdf

The source content remains © Cybersecurity Agency of Singapore. The upstream PDF is the authoritative text; the OSCAL rendering in this repository is unofficial.

The source PDF itself is NOT redistributed from this repository. The `rlinks` in `catalog.json` point to the canonical URL above.

